  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently on both live and beta, the VRCSDK is rather cryptic with some of its feedback. It would be better if we had more verbose feedback from the SDK on what precisely is failing. \n\nOne notable example is when the 5.6 SDK complains about incorrect spine rigging. Is it because LowerChest isn't set? Is it because the hierarchy is incorrect? Right now, you get the same error for both. Having a more specific error message would greatly reduce new player questions/confusion and help with everyone as they transition to 5.6.",
